      "path": "src/coordinators/workspace/restore.ts",
      "content": "This validates the Trade Record summary shape, not the `TradeSummary` used by `RestoreRepair`. Preparation builds this field with `plannedTradeSummary` (line 693), which returns a Stock summary (`kind`, `direction`, `quantity`, `price`) or an Option summary (`contracts`, `expiration`, `strike`, `right`); neither has these record fields. Consequently every legitimately prepared candidate with repairs is rejected as `CandidateChanged` and deleted during apply. Validate the domain summary's discriminated variants instead, and add a successful apply test with nonempty repairs (the new empty-summary rejection test does not detect this regression).",
